<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS3" title="In Appendix B Additional Algorithmic Details and Experimental Results ‣ Detecting Post-generation Edits to Watermarked LLM Outputs via Combinatorial Watermarking" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.3 </span>A Sensitivity Analysis on the Watermark Detectability and Robustness</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Detecting Post-generation Edits to Watermarked LLM Outputs via Combinatorial Watermarking" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Complexity Analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Detecting Post-generation Edits to Watermarked LLM Outputs via Combinatorial Watermarking" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
